{{!
    @template mod_these/single_button_block

    Bouton du cœur (core/single_button) dans un bloc.

    Classes required for JS:
    * none

    Data attributes required for JS:
    * none

    Context variables required for this template:
    * divclass Classes CSS du bloc.
    * button Contexte de core/single_button.

    Example context (json):
    {"divclass": "mb-3", "button": {"method": "get", "id": "buttonid-123", "type": "secondary",
        "url": "https://example.com/mod/these/jurors.php?id=2&action=edit", "tooltip": "",
        "label": "Ajouter un enseignant", "attributes": []} }
}}
<div class="{{divclass}}">{{#button}}{{> core/single_button}}{{/button}}</div>
